  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO Regional component of the Education Cannot Wait (ECW) facilitat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The regional component of the ECW facilitated Multi-Year Resilience Program (MYRP) for the Venezuela Refugee and Migrant Crisis aims to support and complement the country MYRPs for Colombia, Ecuador and Peru. The overall goal of the regional MYRP is to ensure that Venezuelan refugee and migrant children and adolescents in the region, as well as children from host communities, have improved access to inclusive and quality education and achieve learning outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
